# The build context is the cache key for `COPY ui/ .` (Dockerfile:7). Untracked
# local junk under ui/ silently busts the UI-stage layer cache — which is the
# whole point of that stage being cacheable — and `ui/node_modules` from the host
# would overwrite the one `npm ci` just installed one layer earlier.
#
# Do NOT exclude pyproject.toml, src/, or ui/src. src/cerebro_mcp/static/ must
# stay: Dockerfile:36-51 overwrites it with fresh bundles, but `pip install .`
# still builds the wheel from that tree (see pyproject.toml [tool.hatch...]).

.git
.github
.venv
**/node_modules
ui/dist
ui/dist-*

benchmarks/results
tests
.sql-baseline.json
**/__pycache__
.claude/worktrees
